    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Distinguished Four-Bedroom Residence of Exceptional Quality on Magnificent Mature Grounds\r\nSet behind attractive stone entrance walls and piers on a beautifully landscaped site, this outstanding four-bedroom detached bungalow presents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly exceptional family home in one of North Cork's most desirable residential settings.\r\nHaving been comprehensively renovated and upgraded to an exacting standard, the property exudes elegance, comfort and quality throughout. Combining generous proportions, superb natural light and exquisite presentation, this turnkey residence offers a seamless blend of contemporary living and timeless charm.\r\nFrom the moment you enter the welcoming entrance hall, it is immediately apparent that this is a home of distinction. Carefully designed living spaces, high-quality finishes and beautifully maintained gardens combine to create a residence ideally suited to modern family life and effortless entertaining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nThis property consists of entrance canopy, reception hall, sittingroom, kitchen/dining area, livingroom, sunroom, utility room, four bedrooms and bathroom                                                                                                              15'4\" x 14'2\""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance canopy - \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nReception hall - \r\nA spacious and inviting entrance hall, setting the tone for the impeccable standard evident throughout the property.\r\n\r\nSittingroom -  18' 9\"  x  16' 6\" \r\nA beautifully proportioned reception room featuring an elegant bay window, feature fireplace and decorative picture rail, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere ideal for both relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining area -  22' 6\"  x  13' 9\" \r\nThe heart of the home, this impressive kitchen offers generous proportions, excellent storage and ample dining space, making it perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nLivingroom -  16' 6\"  x  13' 7\" \r\nA wonderfully comfortable living space featuring a fireplace with insert stove and fitted cabinetry. This room flows effortlessly into the adjoining accommodation, providing a superb setting for everyday living.\r\n\r\nSunroom -  15' 6\"  x  14' 3\" \r\nBathed in natural light, the sunroom enjoys direct access via sliding patio doors to patio  outdoor entertaining area and manicured gardens beyond, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor living experience.\r\n\r\nUtility room - \r\nPractical and well-appointed, providing additional storage and laundry facilities.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  15' 3\"  x  14' 1\" \r\nA spacious and tranquil retreat overlooking the gardens.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  14' 3\"  x  13' 6\" \r\nGenerous double bedroom with excellent natural light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  11' 4\"  x  10' 6\" \r\nWell-proportioned and versatile accommodation suitable for family or guests.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 -  11' 3\"  x  10' 6\" \r\nIdeal as a bedroom, home office or study.\r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional Outdoor Features\r\nThe grounds surrounding the residence are a particular feature of the property and have been meticulously maintained to create a private and attractive setting.\r\n•\tImpressive hard-pressed tarmacadam driveway to front\r\n•\tExtensive concrete driveway and rear yard.\r\n•\tBeautifully landscaped and mature gardens surrounding the residence.\r\n•\tLarge private site offering excellent potential \r\n-\tWith full planning permission for 550 sq. ft. extension to dwelling house\r\n-\tWith full planning permission for 450 sq. ft. extension to existing garage\r\n•\tSite c.0.65 acres\r\n•\tAttractive stone entrance walls and piers.\r\n•\tOutside water taps.\r\n•\tClothes line.\r\nExtensive Garage & Outbuildings\r\nDetached Garage                                                                                                    39'9\" x 20'2\"\r\nA substantial detached garage featuring an automatic roller door and offering exceptional storage, workshop or business potential.\r\nStore House                                                                                                            14'0\" x 13'0\"\r\nIdeal for storage and general use.\r\nWorkshop                                                                                                                13'1\" x 12'1\"\r\nPerfect for hobbyists, tradespersons or additional workspace requirements.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features\r\n•\tRecently renovated to an exceptional standard\r\n•\tSpacious and beautifully presented family home\r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows and doors throughout.\r\n•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\tFirebird Popular 120 Oil Boiler\r\n•\tMains water supply/Mains sewer\r\n•\tExtensive parking facilities\r\n•\tDetached garage and outbuildings\r\n•\tImmaculate turnkey condition throughout Within walking distance of Mallow town centre, close to shops, schools, Railway Station, bus stop, etc.\r\n\r\n•\tMallow being the crossroads of Munster with easy commuter access to Dublin Road, Cork/Limerick Road and Killarney Road.\r\n\r\n•\tAdjacent to Mallow GAA complex at Carrigoon"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "A Home of Exceptional Character and Quality\r\nRarely does a residence of such quality, scale and presentation come to the market. Occupying magnificent mature grounds and offering generous, light-filled accommodation throughout, Ballyviniter is a home that effortlessly combines elegance, comfort and practicality. Its impeccable finish, extensive outbuildings and beautiful gardens make it an ideal choice for discerning purchasers seeking a prestigious family residence in a highly convenient location close to Mallow Town and all amenities.\r\nViewing of this exceptional home comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment."
      }
